1
00:01:43,800 --> 00:01:47,830
[KING OF COMEDY]

2
00:01:48,620 --> 00:01:50,990
[Episode 1]

3
00:01:51,120 --> 00:01:53,710
[The clip is from the movie
"King of Comedy" (1999).]

4
00:01:52,400 --> 00:01:55,150
Work hard! Strive!

5
00:01:55,150 --> 00:01:56,560
I've watched the movie "King of Comedy,"

6
00:01:56,560 --> 00:01:57,590
since I was a kid,

7
00:01:57,590 --> 00:01:59,710
952.7 times,

8
00:01:59,710 --> 00:02:01,570
plus half a time with commentary.

9
00:02:01,760 --> 00:02:03,950
Because of the line "Work hard! Strive!",

10
00:02:03,950 --> 00:02:06,400
I became an actor when I grew up.

11
00:02:06,400 --> 00:02:07,710
You jerks,

12
00:02:08,960 --> 00:02:10,820
I don't even need to lift a finger.

13
00:02:12,910 --> 00:02:15,360
However, I am not the Great Sage.

14
00:02:23,280 --> 00:02:26,079
Erlang Shen on the opposite side.

15
00:02:26,960 --> 00:02:28,210
Well, I am the one at his feet,

16
00:02:28,210 --> 00:02:29,960
the Howling Celestial Dog.

17
00:02:30,840 --> 00:02:31,360
My dog,

18
00:02:32,100 --> 00:02:34,160
I will still raise you in my next life.

19
00:02:43,079 --> 00:02:43,590
Go.

20
00:02:53,240 --> 00:02:54,300
Not bad, I must say.

21
00:02:56,890 --> 00:02:58,620
This kid is quite interesting.

22
00:03:00,860 --> 00:03:02,730
His sense of belief is incredible.

23
00:03:02,730 --> 00:03:04,840
I mean,
besides the physiological reactions,

24
00:03:04,840 --> 00:03:06,030
this kid has control.

25
00:03:06,030 --> 00:03:06,800
-Did you see that?
-Director Bao,

26
00:03:06,800 --> 00:03:09,600
if you don't yell cut,
he'll be scratched to death.

27
00:03:10,680 --> 00:03:11,680
Cut!

28
00:03:11,680 --> 00:03:12,800
Stop!

29
00:03:14,400 --> 00:03:15,000
Director.

30
00:03:15,840 --> 00:03:16,630
Careful, careful.

31
00:03:16,630 --> 00:03:17,079
Is it okay?

32
00:03:17,079 --> 00:03:18,560
Not bad. What's your name?

33
00:03:18,590 --> 00:03:19,079
Zhou Ke.

34
00:03:19,110 --> 00:03:20,600
Joker, meaning clown.

35
00:03:20,740 --> 00:03:21,940
You really drew me in!

36
00:03:22,560 --> 00:03:23,079
I'm telling you.

37
00:03:23,079 --> 00:03:23,810
This is good.

38
00:03:23,840 --> 00:03:24,240
Really?

39
00:03:24,240 --> 00:03:24,840
Sense of belief.

40
00:03:24,840 --> 00:03:25,240
I'm telling you,

41
00:03:25,240 --> 00:03:26,190
this is really...

42
00:03:26,190 --> 00:03:28,150
No, no, no,
the actor's safety comes first.

43
00:03:28,150 --> 00:03:29,840
Safety matters most, you know?

44
00:03:29,840 --> 00:03:30,750
Acting matters most.

45
00:03:30,750 --> 00:03:32,030
My hair can be ruined, but not the acting.

46
00:03:32,030 --> 00:03:34,090
If you don't yell cut, I won't go home.

47
00:03:34,240 --> 00:03:34,840
Come, come, come.

48
00:03:34,840 --> 00:03:35,840
Everyone in the back, come, come, come.

49
00:03:35,840 --> 00:03:36,870
I'm telling you, this is a role model.

50
00:03:36,870 --> 00:03:37,750
You should learn from him.

51
00:03:37,750 --> 00:03:39,240
This acting, this sense of belief.

52
00:03:39,240 --> 00:03:41,970
He truly deserves
the title of Shudian's Dog God.

53
00:03:42,630 --> 00:03:44,240
-Great!
-Great!

54
00:03:44,840 --> 00:03:46,079
Even though it's just one scene,

55
00:03:46,079 --> 00:03:47,400
this one scene

56
00:03:47,470 --> 00:03:48,680
sets the tone.

57
00:03:48,910 --> 00:03:49,520
That's very hard.

58
00:03:49,520 --> 00:03:51,079
This hasn't even built up much yet.

59
00:03:51,079 --> 00:03:52,200
I didn't show my face just now.

60
00:03:52,200 --> 00:03:53,820
In the later scene
where I turn into a human,

61
00:03:53,820 --> 00:03:54,870
even though it's just one line,

62
00:03:54,870 --> 00:03:56,730
I'll give you 8 layers of emotion.

63
00:03:56,870 --> 00:03:58,190
Listen to that, listen.

64
00:03:58,190 --> 00:04:00,150
I'm saying, if everyone in our industry

65
00:04:00,150 --> 00:04:01,380
were this kind of actor,

66
00:04:01,380 --> 00:04:02,430
wouldn't this industry be great?

67
00:04:02,430 --> 00:04:03,630
Look at his layers,

68
00:04:03,630 --> 00:04:04,910
inner feelings, and control.

69
00:04:04,910 --> 00:04:06,190
It's simply amazing, I'm telling you.

70
00:04:06,190 --> 00:04:07,390
An actor like this...

71
00:04:07,750 --> 00:04:09,470
What's wrong with your face?

72
00:04:11,190 --> 00:04:12,590
W-Why is his face ruined?

73
00:04:12,710 --> 00:04:13,970
He's disfigured, you know?

74
00:04:13,970 --> 00:04:15,150
Makeup, makeup, makeup, come take a look.

75
00:04:15,150 --> 00:04:16,000
I got scratched by a monkey.

76
00:04:16,000 --> 00:04:17,260
Can this be covered up?

77
00:04:17,480 --> 00:04:19,240
It's still bleeding; it can't be covered.

78
00:04:19,240 --> 00:04:19,839
Director.

79
00:04:20,240 --> 00:04:21,300
Let's replace him.

80
00:04:22,600 --> 00:04:23,720
P-Please don't replace me, Director.

81
00:04:23,720 --> 00:04:24,480
I-I heal fast.

82
00:04:24,480 --> 00:04:25,480
I'll hurry up and let it scab.

83
00:04:25,480 --> 00:04:25,920
Wait for me.

84
00:04:25,920 --> 00:04:26,240
Director.

85
00:04:26,240 --> 00:04:26,680
Hurry up.

86
00:04:26,680 --> 00:04:27,280
Director.

87
00:04:27,310 --> 00:04:28,310
We're out of time.

88
00:04:28,720 --> 00:04:30,850
If it doesn't work, let's replace him.

89
00:04:32,720 --> 00:04:34,430
This opportunity didn't come easy for me.

90
00:04:34,430 --> 00:04:35,750
Please don't give up on me.

91
00:04:35,750 --> 00:04:36,360
I,

92
00:04:36,600 --> 00:04:38,630
since graduating
from the Northern Film Academy,

93
00:04:38,630 --> 00:04:39,950
haven't had any acting jobs.

94
00:04:39,950 --> 00:04:41,390
So I burned my bridges,

95
00:04:41,430 --> 00:04:42,720
took out all my savings,

96
00:04:42,720 --> 00:04:45,180
and wrote, directed,
and starred in a movie.

97
00:04:45,360 --> 00:04:47,420
Although it was a miserable failure,

98
00:04:47,510 --> 00:04:48,510
I don't regret it.

99
00:04:48,560 --> 00:04:49,430
For the sake of art,

100
00:04:49,430 --> 00:04:50,480
I took a gamble.

101
00:04:51,390 --> 00:04:52,120
So,

102
00:04:53,720 --> 00:04:55,030
I really need this pay.

103
00:04:55,860 --> 00:04:56,800
Two hundred if I don't show my face,

104
00:04:56,800 --> 00:04:57,630
plus 800 if I do.

105
00:04:57,630 --> 00:04:58,270
We're both artists.

106
00:04:58,270 --> 00:04:59,120
Do me a favor.

107
00:05:00,040 --> 00:05:01,240
What did you say to me?

108
00:05:01,270 --> 00:05:02,000
Do me a favor.

109
00:05:02,430 --> 00:05:03,680
What was the sentence before that?

110
00:05:03,680 --> 00:05:05,070
Plus 800 if I show my face.

111
00:05:05,070 --> 00:05:06,510
I mean that noun.

112
00:05:07,040 --> 00:05:07,560
Artist.

113
00:05:07,560 --> 00:05:08,390
Artist!

114
00:05:09,480 --> 00:05:11,750
You just threw
the word "artist" around, right?

115
00:05:11,750 --> 00:05:12,310
No.

116
00:05:12,510 --> 00:05:13,680
So you said it
from the bottom of your heart.

117
00:05:13,680 --> 00:05:14,270
Yes.

118
00:05:14,270 --> 00:05:17,130
To be able to say
the word "artist" from the heart...

119
00:05:21,240 --> 00:05:22,040
It's not easy.

120
00:05:22,930 --> 00:05:24,120
I think, nowadays,

121
00:05:24,560 --> 00:05:27,360
for someone who doesn't find it
embarrassing

122
00:05:27,360 --> 00:05:29,720
to sincerely express
the word from the heart,

123
00:05:29,720 --> 00:05:31,600
their hearts must be so pure.

124
00:05:34,720 --> 00:05:35,510
You're so much like me.

125
00:05:35,510 --> 00:05:35,800
Yes.

126
00:05:36,310 --> 00:05:37,510
I know what you are like

127
00:05:37,510 --> 00:05:38,920
inside right now.

128
00:05:38,920 --> 00:05:41,480
I also know what you might be facing.

129
00:05:41,630 --> 00:05:42,630
But don't be afraid.

130
00:05:42,630 --> 00:05:43,560
I believe in you.

131
00:05:44,560 --> 00:05:45,159
Thank you.

132
00:05:45,230 --> 00:05:46,310
This role is yours.

133
00:05:46,600 --> 00:05:47,060
Really?

134
00:05:47,060 --> 00:05:48,060
Look into my eyes.

135
00:05:48,270 --> 00:05:49,480
Say it out loud with me.

136
00:05:49,480 --> 00:05:52,070
-This role is yours!
-This role is yours!

137
00:05:52,070 --> 00:05:53,560
-This role is yours!
-This role is yours!

138
00:05:53,560 --> 00:05:54,510
-It's yours!
-It's yours!

139
00:05:54,510 --> 00:05:55,070
It's yours!

140
00:05:55,070 --> 00:05:55,720
Mine, mine!

141
00:05:55,720 --> 00:05:56,680
This role is yours.

142
00:05:56,680 --> 00:05:57,390
This role is mine.

143
00:05:57,390 --> 00:05:58,830
-Believe it. Shout it out.
-Yeah.

144
00:05:58,830 --> 00:05:59,920
This role is yours.

145
00:06:00,160 --> 00:06:01,480
This role belongs to Liu Ke!

146
00:06:01,480 --> 00:06:01,750
I...

147
00:06:04,140 --> 00:06:04,900
Zhou Ke.

148
00:06:07,630 --> 00:06:09,390
Hello, Mr. Erlang Shen.

149
00:06:10,480 --> 00:06:10,920
You...

150
00:06:11,190 --> 00:06:12,680
I'm the Howling Celestial Dog.

151
00:06:12,680 --> 00:06:13,190
Mr. Dog.

152
00:06:13,190 --> 00:06:13,830
Hello, Mr. Dog.

153
00:06:13,830 --> 00:06:14,760
I want to ask you,

154
00:06:14,950 --> 00:06:17,080
how did you get to play such a good role?

155
00:06:19,680 --> 00:06:20,160
Well...

156
00:06:20,830 --> 00:06:21,960
I don't know either.

157
00:06:22,160 --> 00:06:23,770
Maybe it's my looks,

158
00:06:24,070 --> 00:06:24,800
my aura,

159
00:06:25,630 --> 00:06:26,360
and my height.

160
00:06:26,360 --> 00:06:27,600
I... I got it.

161
00:06:27,600 --> 00:06:28,600
Please, have a seat.

162
00:06:28,600 --> 00:06:29,930
It's quite cold up here.

163
00:06:30,480 --> 00:06:32,210
What about you, the Great Sage?

164
00:06:34,510 --> 00:06:34,920
Dad.

165
00:06:37,830 --> 00:06:39,230
The director is your dad?

166
00:06:39,390 --> 00:06:40,830
It's all about connections.

167
00:06:40,830 --> 00:06:42,960
My dad became a director because of me.

168
00:06:44,550 --> 00:06:46,190
He said if he didn't become a director,

169
00:06:46,190 --> 00:06:47,720
he wouldn't be my dad either.

170
00:06:47,720 --> 00:06:50,190
I told the producer
I had to bring my dad to the crew.

171
00:06:50,190 --> 00:06:51,360
I need a dad.

172
00:06:52,950 --> 00:06:53,750
I want a dad.

173
00:06:53,750 --> 00:06:54,880
Okay, alright, dad.

174
00:06:55,600 --> 00:06:56,270
Dad, no.

175
00:06:56,270 --> 00:06:58,330
Director, Mr. Bao, what did they say?

176
00:07:02,830 --> 00:07:04,090
This is what they said.

177
00:07:04,680 --> 00:07:05,610
My condolences.

178
00:07:05,630 --> 00:07:07,090
Let's settle the payment.

179
00:07:08,070 --> 00:07:10,430
I'm giving you
this 100 out of my own pocket.

180
00:07:10,430 --> 00:07:12,240
50 to support your dream,

181
00:07:13,400 --> 00:07:15,280
and 50 for a rabies vaccine, bro.

182
00:07:18,560 --> 00:07:19,160
Director,

183
00:07:19,430 --> 00:07:22,360
who's going to play
the Howling Celestial Dog later?

184
00:07:26,240 --> 00:07:28,270
I don't know if I can hold on.

185
00:07:32,270 --> 00:07:32,830
Come on.

186
00:07:32,830 --> 00:07:33,920
Let's get to work.

187
00:07:37,510 --> 00:07:39,370
Then what do you think I should do?

188
00:07:40,480 --> 00:07:41,830
Aren't you ruined
by the movie "King of Comedy"

189
00:07:41,830 --> 00:07:43,760
and the line "Work hard! Strive!"?

190
00:07:44,390 --> 00:07:45,120
You fooled me

191
00:07:45,159 --> 00:07:46,120
into coming here,

192
00:07:46,120 --> 00:07:47,240
saying you'd make me your agent,

193
00:07:47,240 --> 00:07:48,070
and that in Shudian,

194
00:07:48,070 --> 00:07:49,240
we could make big money.

195
00:07:49,240 --> 00:07:49,920
-And what happened?
-Alright.

196
00:07:49,920 --> 00:07:50,310
Wait.

197
00:07:50,560 --> 00:07:52,690
The point is when I'll pay off the debt.

198
00:07:53,190 --> 00:07:54,320
I owe my third uncle,

199
00:07:54,600 --> 00:07:55,720
your mom, my second aunt,

200
00:07:55,720 --> 00:07:56,390
and my mom.

201
00:07:56,750 --> 00:07:58,159
The more I talk about it,
the angrier I get.

202
00:07:58,159 --> 00:08:00,070
You insisted on crowdfunding a movie

203
00:08:00,070 --> 00:08:02,070
and put all the family's money into it.

204
00:08:02,070 --> 00:08:03,730
I can still handle the family,

205
00:08:04,040 --> 00:08:05,430
but what about the outsiders?

206
00:08:05,430 --> 00:08:07,090
What do you think we should do?

207
00:08:09,040 --> 00:08:10,870
Taking these small jobs
every day like this.

208
00:08:10,870 --> 00:08:12,310
When will it end?

209
00:08:15,680 --> 00:08:16,120
Director Bao.

210
00:08:16,120 --> 00:08:17,360
-Mr. Bao.
-Pick up.

211
00:08:19,240 --> 00:08:22,040
Mr. Bao, what's up?
You want me for that role again?

212
00:08:23,560 --> 00:08:24,870
Something else? That works too.

213
00:08:24,870 --> 00:08:26,160
Sure, anything works.

214
00:08:28,430 --> 00:08:28,830
Well,

215
00:08:29,070 --> 00:08:29,720
there might be

216
00:08:29,720 --> 00:08:30,750
a scheduling conflict.

217
00:08:30,750 --> 00:08:31,150
Right.

218
00:08:31,830 --> 00:08:32,720
Sorry, Mr. Bao.

219
00:08:33,039 --> 00:08:34,340
Next time. Okay, great.

220
00:08:34,340 --> 00:08:35,400
Thank you, Mr. Bao.

221
00:08:36,150 --> 00:08:36,840
Wait a minute.

222
00:08:36,840 --> 00:08:38,789
Why did you turn down this job?

223
00:08:40,030 --> 00:08:41,200
You have a scheduling conflict?

224
00:08:41,200 --> 00:08:42,669
All you have is free time.

225
00:08:43,720 --> 00:08:44,580
It's a funeral.

226
00:08:47,510 --> 00:08:49,870
A funeral? Why can't you
take a funeral job?

227
00:08:49,870 --> 00:08:51,330
A funeral is also a form...

228
00:08:52,030 --> 00:08:53,080
of saying goodbye.

229
00:08:53,080 --> 00:08:54,440
We can just say goodbye to the past.

230
00:08:54,440 --> 00:08:55,120
Forget it.

231
00:08:55,120 --> 00:08:57,000
I'll just focus on this wedding first.

232
00:08:57,000 --> 00:08:57,910
Let's hope for good luck.

233
00:08:57,910 --> 00:08:58,960
What are you afraid of? Let's just go.

234
00:08:58,960 --> 00:09:00,150
Red is auspicious.

235
00:09:00,150 --> 00:09:00,960
Call Director Bao.

236
00:09:00,960 --> 00:09:02,120
Let's go. I'm telling you, let's go.

237
00:09:02,120 --> 00:09:02,910
Zhou Ke.

238
00:09:05,840 --> 00:09:06,600
Xing?

239
00:09:07,480 --> 00:09:08,240
Yang Shan?

240
00:09:11,960 --> 00:09:13,760
Is this the big job you got for me?

241
00:09:14,630 --> 00:09:17,030
Why did you get me a job
at my first love's wedding?

242
00:09:17,030 --> 00:09:18,000
I didn't know.

243
00:09:19,510 --> 00:09:20,870
I was just looking for you.

244
00:09:20,870 --> 00:09:21,990
Let me introduce you.

245
00:09:21,990 --> 00:09:24,540
This is the senior MC I found for you.

246
00:09:26,080 --> 00:09:27,340
No, there's a mistake.

247
00:09:27,600 --> 00:09:29,080
He is our high school classmate.

248
00:09:29,080 --> 00:09:30,200
Senior MC.

249
00:09:30,440 --> 00:09:31,360
High school classmate.

250
00:09:31,360 --> 00:09:32,790
Well, I am a senior MC.

251
00:09:33,120 --> 00:09:34,320
And also a high school classmate.

252
00:09:34,320 --> 00:09:35,450
What a coincidence.

253
00:09:36,910 --> 00:09:38,040
Ditching the agent?

254
00:09:39,120 --> 00:09:41,720
Magpies are chirping on the branches.

255
00:09:41,870 --> 00:09:44,630
The beautiful bride
gets into the sedan chair.

256
00:09:44,870 --> 00:09:46,630
Let our handsome groom

257
00:09:46,630 --> 00:09:49,360
kiss our beautiful bride.

258
00:09:53,960 --> 00:09:55,410
Thank you.

259
00:09:55,440 --> 00:09:57,150
Just hire me as the MC
for the baby's one-month celebration.

260
00:09:57,150 --> 00:09:57,960
Take it.

261
00:10:02,480 --> 00:10:03,540
Congratulations.

262
00:10:05,240 --> 00:10:06,390
Why did you give 2,000 as a gift?

263
00:10:06,390 --> 00:10:08,030
Don't you know how much money you owe?

264
00:10:08,030 --> 00:10:08,960
Let's just go.

265
00:10:11,720 --> 00:10:12,270
What?

266
00:10:18,960 --> 00:10:19,840
Director Bao,

267
00:10:20,270 --> 00:10:23,360
about holding a funeral
for the sister you mentioned,

268
00:10:23,430 --> 00:10:24,200
is it still available?

269
00:10:24,200 --> 00:10:24,870
Yes, it is.

270
00:10:26,600 --> 00:10:27,790
A happy event

271
00:10:28,270 --> 00:10:30,320
allowed me to meet her from the past.

272
00:10:33,030 --> 00:10:34,270
At a funeral,

273
00:10:35,000 --> 00:10:36,910
I didn't expect to meet...

274
00:10:37,180 --> 00:10:40,980
[Shapu Village Station]

275
00:10:48,840 --> 00:10:49,440
This is the place.

276
00:10:49,440 --> 00:10:49,960
Get out.

277
00:11:27,030 --> 00:11:28,150
It's so cold.

278
00:11:28,550 --> 00:11:31,000
When are you coming to pick me up?

279
00:11:47,000 --> 00:11:47,790
Ghost!

280
00:11:56,830 --> 00:11:57,960
Why are you running?

281
00:11:59,720 --> 00:12:00,320
Help!

282
00:12:16,440 --> 00:12:17,630
Do you think

283
00:12:17,960 --> 00:12:19,320
I'm going to eat you?

284
00:12:25,670 --> 00:12:28,290
[Zhen]

285
00:12:28,750 --> 00:12:35,500
[Ten hours ago]

286
00:12:40,200 --> 00:12:41,060
Pay attention.

287
00:12:41,150 --> 00:12:42,720
This girl is called Zhen,

288
00:12:43,910 --> 00:12:45,970
the fish ball beauty of Shapu Village

289
00:12:46,600 --> 00:12:48,030
and the owner of the filming location

290
00:12:48,030 --> 00:12:49,630
for the movie "King of Comedy."

291
00:12:48,790 --> 00:12:51,650
[King of Comedy Scene,
Neighborhood Theatre]

292
00:12:51,750 --> 00:12:54,000
This house has a very special meaning

293
00:12:54,000 --> 00:12:56,080
for Zhen.

294
00:12:58,600 --> 00:13:00,600
So whoever disturbs her home

295
00:13:00,910 --> 00:13:03,240
disturbs her life.

296
00:13:03,240 --> 00:13:04,030
Zhen!

297
00:13:05,360 --> 00:13:06,000
Zhen!

298
00:13:06,240 --> 00:13:06,870
Zhen!

299
00:13:09,230 --> 00:13:10,670
What's wrong, Auntie Chaoyue?

300
00:13:10,670 --> 00:13:11,380
Someone...

301
00:13:12,840 --> 00:13:14,170
Is going to tear down...

302
00:13:14,260 --> 00:13:15,380
Your house!

303
00:13:15,630 --> 00:13:16,070
What?

304
00:13:41,450 --> 00:13:42,230
Excuse me!

305
00:13:54,000 --> 00:13:55,730
Who dares to tear down my house?

306
00:14:05,960 --> 00:14:07,360
What are you doing, Zhen?

307
00:14:10,660 --> 00:14:11,970
We live in a society governed by law now!

308
00:14:11,970 --> 00:14:13,720
How can you forcibly demolish my house?

309
00:14:13,720 --> 00:14:14,550
This isn't your house.

310
00:14:14,550 --> 00:14:15,790
It's your brother's house.

311
00:14:15,790 --> 00:14:17,200
My brother's house is my house!

312
00:14:17,200 --> 00:14:19,440
Besides, my brother
wouldn't agree to it either!

313
00:14:19,440 --> 00:14:19,910
Sister!

314
00:14:22,670 --> 00:14:24,600
Get out of the way. It's dangerous!

315
00:14:24,670 --> 00:14:26,080
Chen Jiahao?

316
00:14:26,600 --> 00:14:27,360
Are you crazy?

317
00:14:27,360 --> 00:14:28,840
Tearing down your own house? You're crazy!

318
00:14:28,840 --> 00:14:30,380
So you mean we shouldn't tear it down?

319
00:14:30,380 --> 00:14:31,690
Isn't that obvious?

320
00:14:31,720 --> 00:14:32,670
Since my sister says no,

321
00:14:32,670 --> 00:14:34,150
I won't tear it down for now.

322
00:14:34,150 --> 00:14:34,610
Sister.

323
00:14:35,080 --> 00:14:35,840
What's wrong?

324
00:14:35,840 --> 00:14:37,080
I mean, really.

325
00:14:37,390 --> 00:14:38,870
Even if it's going to be demolished,

326
00:14:38,870 --> 00:14:40,600
there's a demolition team for that.

327
00:14:40,600 --> 00:14:42,360
Why did you spend your own money
to rent an excavator?

328
00:14:42,360 --> 00:14:43,070
What's the point?

329
00:14:43,070 --> 00:14:45,120
I want to run for village chief,

330
00:14:45,190 --> 00:14:46,750
so I'm setting a good example,

331
00:14:46,750 --> 00:14:48,320
then everyone will vote for me.

332
00:14:48,320 --> 00:14:49,450
I've calculated it.

333
00:14:49,550 --> 00:14:50,810
With 2,400 yuan per square meter,

334
00:14:50,810 --> 00:14:52,600
our land is worth over 300,000.

335
00:14:52,870 --> 00:14:53,670
Do you know how much it cost

336
00:14:53,670 --> 00:14:54,810
to renovate this yard?

337
00:14:54,810 --> 00:14:55,320
I don't know.

338
00:14:55,320 --> 00:14:56,720
Do you know how much it cost

339
00:14:56,720 --> 00:14:57,630
to decorate the inside?

340
00:14:57,630 --> 00:14:59,090
So how much do we have left?

341
00:14:59,120 --> 00:15:00,320
We're 50,000 in debt!

342
00:15:01,240 --> 00:15:02,550
We can't tear it down!

343
00:15:03,020 --> 00:15:04,020
Villagers!

344
00:15:05,600 --> 00:15:07,360
Everyone, listen to me!

345
00:15:07,360 --> 00:15:08,160
Listen to her!

346
00:15:08,240 --> 00:15:10,240
We all make a living by fishing!

347
00:15:10,670 --> 00:15:12,600
If we move to the city
after the demolition,

348
00:15:12,600 --> 00:15:14,240
how will we survive?

349
00:15:14,600 --> 00:15:16,860
We can't make this kind of one-time deal!

350
00:15:17,030 --> 00:15:18,490
The village chief is here!

351
00:15:19,030 --> 00:15:19,750
Quiet!

352
00:15:21,840 --> 00:15:23,840
Stop arguing! Quiet!

353
00:15:27,360 --> 00:15:28,510
-Uncle Huixian.
-Uncle Huixian.

354
00:15:28,510 --> 00:15:29,440
Why are you here?

355
00:15:29,670 --> 00:15:31,080
I heard at the village committee

356
00:15:31,080 --> 00:15:32,240
that you two siblings

357
00:15:32,240 --> 00:15:34,030
were inciting everyone
to oppose the demolition.

358
00:15:34,030 --> 00:15:36,350
Uncle Huixian, you're a sensible person.

359
00:15:36,350 --> 00:15:37,720
How could you agree to the demolition?

360
00:15:37,720 --> 00:15:40,120
You know the situation in our village.

361
00:15:40,270 --> 00:15:42,000
The fishing industry
hasn't been good these past 2 years.

362
00:15:42,000 --> 00:15:43,990
The young people
have all gone to the city to work.

363
00:15:43,990 --> 00:15:46,040
Only the old, weak, sick,
and disabled are left,

364
00:15:46,040 --> 00:15:47,750
along with these rows of
dilapidated houses.

365
00:15:47,750 --> 00:15:50,960
Fortunately, Mr. Huang
from Ma Construction Group

366
00:15:50,960 --> 00:15:52,390
took a fancy to our place.

367
00:15:52,550 --> 00:15:55,240
The neighboring Chuanao Village
thrives in cultural tourism.

368
00:15:55,240 --> 00:15:56,840
We can do cultural tourism too.

369
00:15:56,840 --> 00:15:57,240
Right.

370
00:15:57,510 --> 00:16:00,150
What have you been messing around with
these past few years?

371
00:16:00,150 --> 00:16:01,550
First, you copied Harbin

372
00:16:01,560 --> 00:16:02,750
and made ice sculptures.

373
00:16:02,750 --> 00:16:05,000
Then you copied Zibo and did barbecue.

374
00:16:05,020 --> 00:16:06,390
Tell me, which of these things

375
00:16:06,390 --> 00:16:07,840
have you actually accomplished?

376
00:16:07,840 --> 00:16:09,480
Didn't we also create

377
00:16:09,480 --> 00:16:10,940
a video channel for Shapu?

378
00:16:10,990 --> 00:16:12,100
[Shapu Resort Silver Beach]

379
00:16:12,130 --> 00:16:14,480
[12 followers]

380
00:16:14,510 --> 00:16:16,360
It's been half a year, and I counted.

381
00:16:16,360 --> 00:16:18,150
You have 12 followers so far.

382
00:16:18,150 --> 00:16:20,960
It didn't succeed before
because I got the direction wrong.

383
00:16:20,960 --> 00:16:23,030
I was just focused on imitating others.

384
00:16:23,030 --> 00:16:25,200
I forgot our village's biggest advantage.

385
00:16:25,200 --> 00:16:26,130
What advantage?

386
00:16:26,300 --> 00:16:29,300
Our house is the filming location
of "King of Comedy."

387
00:16:30,270 --> 00:16:31,600
Don't even mention that.

388
00:16:31,600 --> 00:16:33,790
Stephen Chow came here
to film for 3 days back then.

389
00:16:33,790 --> 00:16:34,910
Then a typhoon hit,

390
00:16:34,910 --> 00:16:36,790
and they went back to Hong Kong to film.

391
00:16:36,790 --> 00:16:37,600
To be exact,

392
00:16:37,750 --> 00:16:39,440
it's called the attempted filming location

393
00:16:39,440 --> 00:16:41,040
of "King of Comedy."

394
00:16:41,420 --> 00:16:42,420
Give me some time.

395
00:16:42,550 --> 00:16:43,870
I'll use the IP of "King of Comedy"

396
00:16:43,870 --> 00:16:44,600
to make our village

397
00:16:44,600 --> 00:16:45,200
popular.

398
00:16:45,270 --> 00:16:46,720
If it succeeds, we won't demolish it.

399
00:16:46,720 --> 00:16:47,600
If it doesn't succeed,

400
00:16:47,600 --> 00:16:48,930
I'll drive an excavator

401
00:16:49,080 --> 00:16:50,810
and demolish our house myself.

402
00:16:50,960 --> 00:16:51,390
Okay.

403
00:16:51,870 --> 00:16:53,150
What counts as success?

404
00:16:53,150 --> 00:16:54,270
Building up the video channel

405
00:16:54,270 --> 00:16:54,790
and increasing the followers.

406
00:16:54,790 --> 00:16:55,440
How many followers?

407
00:16:55,440 --> 00:16:56,360
-100,000.
-How long?

408
00:16:56,360 --> 00:16:57,620
-Four years.
-Go away.

409
00:16:57,790 --> 00:16:59,790
-One year.
-I won’t give you one day.

410
00:17:00,000 --> 00:17:00,390
Uncle,

411
00:17:00,390 --> 00:17:01,320
I'm begging you.

412
00:17:01,340 --> 00:17:03,490
-Uncle Huixian.
-I'm begging you.

413
00:17:03,570 --> 00:17:05,200
Give us some time.

414
00:17:05,200 --> 00:17:06,069
I'm begging you.

415
00:17:06,069 --> 00:17:07,680
I'm begging you.

416
00:17:09,079 --> 00:17:10,920
Junnan, this is bad!

417
00:17:11,310 --> 00:17:12,970
Someone is bullying your Zhen.

418
00:17:12,970 --> 00:17:14,140
W-Where?

419
00:17:14,170 --> 00:17:14,750
Where is it?

420
00:17:14,750 --> 00:17:15,750
Let's go!

421
00:17:16,310 --> 00:17:16,960
Stop!

422
00:17:17,510 --> 00:17:19,369
Let me see who dares to bully Zhen!

423
00:17:23,349 --> 00:17:24,349
This is my nephew.

424
00:17:24,450 --> 00:17:24,920
Wait.

425
00:17:25,160 --> 00:17:26,290
Uncle, you're here.

426
00:17:26,720 --> 00:17:27,650
Why are you here?

427
00:17:27,680 --> 00:17:28,540
To protect you.

428
00:17:28,960 --> 00:17:29,830
I don't need your protection.

429
00:17:29,830 --> 00:17:31,270
I'll protect my sister myself.

430
00:17:31,270 --> 00:17:31,790
Okay, okay, okay.

431
00:17:31,790 --> 00:17:33,000
You protect her yourself.

432
00:17:33,000 --> 00:17:33,460
Nephew.

433
00:17:33,510 --> 00:17:33,910
Uncle.

434
00:17:35,510 --> 00:17:36,770
What's the situation?

435
00:17:37,030 --> 00:17:38,920
Our village is going to be demolished,
right?

436
00:17:38,920 --> 00:17:40,120
Zhen doesn't want to.

437
00:17:40,160 --> 00:17:41,680
She insists on doing cultural tourism.

438
00:17:41,680 --> 00:17:42,680
She said in 7 days,

439
00:17:42,960 --> 00:17:45,030
she'd surely get the account
up to 100,000 followers.

440
00:17:45,030 --> 00:17:45,760
Understood.

441
00:17:46,790 --> 00:17:48,390
Let me decide on this matter.

442
00:17:48,720 --> 00:17:49,400
Then...

443
00:17:49,720 --> 00:17:51,320
give Zhen a little more time.

444
00:17:52,400 --> 00:17:52,800
Uncle.

445
00:17:52,960 --> 00:17:54,680
Why do you get to decide, Uncle?

446
00:17:54,680 --> 00:17:55,350
A mother's brother
holds the highest standing.

447
00:17:55,350 --> 00:17:57,080
What's wrong with me deciding?

448
00:17:58,550 --> 00:18:00,810
100,000 followers is not a small number.

449
00:18:00,880 --> 00:18:02,680
Even if we give them time,
they won't be able to do it.

450
00:18:02,680 --> 00:18:03,210
Yes, yes.

451
00:18:04,880 --> 00:18:05,550
Once the time is up,

452
00:18:05,550 --> 00:18:06,510
they will give up.

453
00:18:06,510 --> 00:18:07,200
Besides,

454
00:18:07,790 --> 00:18:09,990
it's not like you don't know I like Zhen.

455
00:18:10,360 --> 00:18:11,070
Do me a favor.

456
00:18:11,070 --> 00:18:11,930
It's a win-win.

457
00:18:12,240 --> 00:18:13,570
You'll even get an aunt.

458
00:18:15,590 --> 00:18:16,590
Okay, okay, fine.

459
00:18:16,790 --> 00:18:18,130
Then... I guess that works.

460
00:18:18,130 --> 00:18:20,330
Zhen, I'll give you 7 days.

461
00:18:25,790 --> 00:18:27,190
As expected of my sister.

462
00:18:27,960 --> 00:18:29,690
I'm my sister's biggest fan now!

463
00:18:29,690 --> 00:18:31,510
See how you roasted Uncle Huixian.

464
00:18:31,510 --> 00:18:32,670
He lost for words.

465
00:18:32,880 --> 00:18:33,880
When I become a chief in the future,

466
00:18:33,880 --> 00:18:35,020
I want to be one like you.

467
00:18:35,020 --> 00:18:35,510
Looking for a book.

468
00:18:35,510 --> 00:18:35,920
Okay.

469
00:18:37,350 --> 00:18:38,970
What book are you looking for?

470
00:18:38,970 --> 00:18:40,700
A book on how to gain followers.

471
00:18:44,030 --> 00:18:45,290
Learning it right now?

472
00:18:45,880 --> 00:18:47,450
There's no time for that!

473
00:18:47,480 --> 00:18:50,150
You already promised them
100,000 followers in 7 days!

474
00:18:50,150 --> 00:18:51,520
The name of the book is

475
00:18:51,550 --> 00:18:53,480
"How to Become a Million-Follower
Influencer in 70 Days."

476
00:18:53,480 --> 00:18:55,940
Doesn't that mean exactly
100,000 in 7 days?

477
00:18:56,200 --> 00:18:57,240
If reading a book worked,

478
00:18:57,240 --> 00:18:59,160
wouldn't everyone
be a million-follower influencer?

479
00:18:59,160 --> 00:19:00,310
Then you figure something out!

480
00:19:00,310 --> 00:19:02,310
I'll go inside and look for the book.

481
00:19:04,680 --> 00:19:05,600
I found it!

482
00:19:07,720 --> 00:19:08,450
You found it?

483
00:19:09,030 --> 00:19:10,810
[Top Schools' Full-Mark Essays
for Primary-to-Junior High Entrance]

484
00:19:11,070 --> 00:19:12,160
Wait, can you even read?

485
00:19:12,160 --> 00:19:12,720
Not this one.

486
00:19:12,720 --> 00:19:13,750
Not this one.

487
00:19:13,750 --> 00:19:14,790
I know, not the book,

488
00:19:14,790 --> 00:19:17,650
but this phone number
in the book! The phone number!

489
00:19:18,790 --> 00:19:19,590
Phone number?

490
00:19:19,640 --> 00:19:20,700
What phone number?

491
00:19:20,790 --> 00:19:21,190
Hello?

492
00:19:21,330 --> 00:19:21,850
Hello.

493
00:19:22,310 --> 00:19:23,240
Is this Mr. Bao?

494
00:19:24,030 --> 00:19:25,630
Um, do you still remember me?

495
00:19:25,680 --> 00:19:26,420
It's Jiahao.

496
00:19:26,550 --> 00:19:27,240
Jiahao?

497
00:19:28,420 --> 00:19:29,550
I remember, I remember.

498
00:19:29,550 --> 00:19:30,590
Wang Jiahao, right?

499
00:19:30,590 --> 00:19:31,830
Chen Jiahao, Mr. Bao.

500
00:19:32,310 --> 00:19:33,720
Chen Jia... close enough.

501
00:19:33,720 --> 00:19:34,310
What's up? Tell me.

502
00:19:34,310 --> 00:19:35,550
Mr. Bao, do you remember

503
00:19:35,550 --> 00:19:37,030
a couple of years ago in Shudian,

504
00:19:37,030 --> 00:19:38,830
when we delivered box lunches to the crew?

505
00:19:38,830 --> 00:19:40,240
And do you remember back then,

506
00:19:40,240 --> 00:19:41,400
there was one time you got sick,

507
00:19:41,400 --> 00:19:42,640
and we took you to the hospital?

508
00:19:42,640 --> 00:19:43,310
You said then

509
00:19:43,310 --> 00:19:45,000
that no matter what happened to me
in the future,

510
00:19:45,000 --> 00:19:46,000
I could come to you.

511
00:19:46,000 --> 00:19:47,180
Come to me no matter what happens?

512
00:19:47,180 --> 00:19:48,240
Yeah, no problem.

513
00:19:48,880 --> 00:19:50,480
100,000 followers in 7 days?

514
00:19:51,480 --> 00:19:52,410
For 20,000 yuan?

515
00:19:53,360 --> 00:19:54,410
N-No problem.

516
00:19:54,440 --> 00:19:54,960
Really?

517
00:19:54,960 --> 00:19:55,760
Leave it to me.

518
00:19:56,270 --> 00:19:57,030
Hello, Lyu?

519
00:19:57,590 --> 00:19:58,670
There's this thing.

520
00:19:58,670 --> 00:20:00,590
I wouldn't call you for ordinary matters.

521
00:20:00,590 --> 00:20:01,390
I have a buddy.

522
00:20:01,570 --> 00:20:03,300
His sister has a video channel.

523
00:20:03,350 --> 00:20:05,880
And she wants to gain
100,000 followers in 7 days.

524
00:20:05,880 --> 00:20:07,310
Do you think you can handle this?

525
00:20:07,310 --> 00:20:07,970
So-and-so?

526
00:20:08,240 --> 00:20:08,830
I have a buddy.

527
00:20:08,830 --> 00:20:09,960
He has a sister.

528
00:20:10,160 --> 00:20:10,790
She runs a video channel.

529
00:20:10,790 --> 00:20:12,180
Said she needs to gain
100,000 followers in 7 days.

530
00:20:12,180 --> 00:20:12,880
She's anxious.

531
00:20:12,880 --> 00:20:13,720
Can you help out?

532
00:20:13,720 --> 00:20:14,160
Teng.

533
00:20:14,270 --> 00:20:15,350
My buddy has a sister.

534
00:20:15,350 --> 00:20:16,270
What kind of channel does she have?

535
00:20:16,270 --> 00:20:16,920
A video channel.

536
00:20:16,920 --> 00:20:17,720
Said she's a patient.

537
00:20:17,720 --> 00:20:18,070
Right.

538
00:20:18,070 --> 00:20:19,310
Then what does she want to do in 7 days?

539
00:20:19,310 --> 00:20:20,350
She wants to eat 10 bowls of rice noodles.

540
00:20:20,350 --> 00:20:21,750
Wants to eat 10 bowls of rice noodles
in 7 days.

541
00:20:21,750 --> 00:20:23,520
Right. We can't order rice noodles
for delivery here.

542
00:20:23,520 --> 00:20:24,350
-Do you have any connections?
-Do you have any connections?

543
00:20:24,350 --> 00:20:26,200
There's a patient who's dying.

544
00:20:26,350 --> 00:20:27,790
Said she wants to eat 10 bowls
of rice noodles in 7 days.

545
00:20:27,790 --> 00:20:28,590
What 10 bowls of noodles?

546
00:20:28,590 --> 00:20:29,510
They said 10 graves.

547
00:20:29,510 --> 00:20:30,860
It sounded like 10 bowls of rice noodles.

548
00:20:30,860 --> 00:20:32,370
My friend's sister died.

549
00:20:32,400 --> 00:20:33,260
Can you figure something out?

550
00:20:33,260 --> 00:20:35,070
What resurrection? Looking for graves.

551
00:20:35,070 --> 00:20:35,920
Do you have any connections?

552
00:20:35,920 --> 00:20:36,830
I have connections.

553
00:20:36,830 --> 00:20:38,630
I'll find someone to get it done.

554
00:20:38,850 --> 00:20:39,790
[Director Bao Huang]

555
00:20:39,960 --> 00:20:40,960
The sister died.

556
00:20:40,960 --> 00:20:42,030
It's a funeral.

557
00:20:42,640 --> 00:20:44,480
It's not easy to find someone for this.

558
00:20:44,480 --> 00:20:45,740
Offering 18,000 yuan?

559
00:20:46,110 --> 00:20:47,040
Leave this to me.

560
00:20:48,160 --> 00:20:49,240
Artist.

561
00:20:49,510 --> 00:20:50,440
I believe in you.

562
00:20:52,200 --> 00:20:53,860
I have someone suitable here.

563
00:20:55,880 --> 00:20:57,140
Director Bao, Mr. Bao.

564
00:20:57,310 --> 00:20:58,550
What's up?
You want me for that role again?

565
00:20:58,550 --> 00:21:00,350
There's a job. A funeral.

566
00:21:00,960 --> 00:21:04,230
[10 p.m. Shapu Village Bus Station]

567
00:21:02,270 --> 00:21:03,130
Just like that.

568
00:21:03,440 --> 00:21:05,400
A few baffling guys

569
00:21:05,680 --> 00:21:07,400
made a few baffling calls.

570
00:21:08,160 --> 00:21:09,750
The story of Zhen and me

571
00:21:10,080 --> 00:21:12,640
started inexplicably just like that.

572
00:21:12,780 --> 00:21:15,790
[Shapu Village Station]

573
00:21:17,070 --> 00:21:17,680
Here.

574
00:21:18,240 --> 00:21:19,960
I'll go collect debts with you in a while.

575
00:21:19,960 --> 00:21:21,200
There's no time.

576
00:21:21,350 --> 00:21:23,810
Don't you still have to
pick up that planner?

577
00:21:24,310 --> 00:21:25,170
I really can't.

578
00:21:25,590 --> 00:21:26,520
I was thinking of

579
00:21:26,640 --> 00:21:29,300
picking him up
after collecting debts with you.

580
00:21:29,400 --> 00:21:31,200
I can go collect debts by myself.

581
00:21:33,750 --> 00:21:34,280
Alright.

582
00:21:35,290 --> 00:21:36,690
Your hands are freezing.

583
00:21:44,550 --> 00:21:45,280
Give it to me.

584
00:21:45,750 --> 00:21:46,200
What?

585
00:21:46,830 --> 00:21:47,960
Where's the ledger?

586
00:21:50,550 --> 00:21:51,950
It's in that coat pocket.

587
00:21:52,550 --> 00:21:54,310
Why are you always so forgetful?

588
00:21:54,310 --> 00:21:55,000
Well...

589
00:21:55,000 --> 00:21:56,640
I'll have Xing drive me back to get it.

590
00:21:56,640 --> 00:21:57,510
Wait for me here.

591
00:21:57,510 --> 00:21:58,400
Hurry up.

592
00:21:58,400 --> 00:21:59,130
Are you cold?

593
00:21:59,270 --> 00:22:00,070
I'm not cold. Hurry up.

594
00:22:00,070 --> 00:22:01,110
I'll give you my coat.

595
00:22:01,110 --> 00:22:02,400
Don't bother. Hurry up.

596
00:22:02,400 --> 00:22:03,440
-Hurry up!
-Okay.

597
00:22:09,160 --> 00:22:10,350
Don't run around!

598
00:22:10,750 --> 00:22:11,640
Got it!

599
00:22:23,440 --> 00:22:25,550
When the Li family's sister
from the fishing village was buried,

600
00:22:25,550 --> 00:22:26,750
according to custom,

601
00:22:26,920 --> 00:22:30,050
her brother placed two paper figures
next to the coffin.

602
00:22:30,240 --> 00:22:33,370
On the way to the funeral,
a strong wind suddenly blew up.

603
00:22:33,550 --> 00:22:34,880
Ke, we're here.

604
00:22:34,880 --> 00:22:36,590
Wake up. Time to work.

605
00:22:40,880 --> 00:22:41,920
I'm bursting.

606
00:22:42,750 --> 00:22:43,310
Well,

607
00:22:43,750 --> 00:22:45,150
wait for me here for a bit.

608
00:22:45,240 --> 00:22:47,320
I'll find a restroom and be right back.

609
00:22:47,320 --> 00:22:48,510
Wake up. Sober up.

610
00:22:55,680 --> 00:22:56,880
This fishing village

611
00:22:58,160 --> 00:22:59,220
is really quite...

612
00:23:03,250 --> 00:23:04,180
beautiful.

613
00:23:22,920 --> 00:23:23,510
Hello.

614
00:23:41,350 --> 00:23:42,400
It's so cold.

615
00:23:44,510 --> 00:23:46,350
When are you coming to pick me up?

616
00:23:52,720 --> 00:23:54,720
When are you coming to pick me up?

617
00:24:23,920 --> 00:24:25,160
Sister.

618
00:24:25,830 --> 00:24:26,200
What's wrong?

619
00:24:26,200 --> 00:24:26,660
Sister.

620
00:24:26,960 --> 00:24:27,640
I...

621
00:24:28,590 --> 00:24:29,240
What is it?

622
00:24:29,240 --> 00:24:30,960
I told you not to take this funeral job.

623
00:24:30,960 --> 00:24:32,110
It's a bit creepy.

624
00:24:32,350 --> 00:24:33,260
What happened?

625
00:24:35,240 --> 00:24:36,240
The truck is here.

626
00:24:37,920 --> 00:24:38,380
Sister.

627
00:24:39,350 --> 00:24:41,950
What are you listening to,
smiling like a fool?

628
00:24:42,000 --> 00:24:43,070
Listening to a novel.

629
00:24:43,070 --> 00:24:45,000
I'm not cold. I'm sweating so much.

630
00:24:45,000 --> 00:24:46,480
Yeah, I'm pretty hot too.

631
00:24:46,480 --> 00:24:47,960
Are you still drunk?

632
00:24:48,200 --> 00:24:48,960
No.

633
00:24:49,160 --> 00:24:50,890
Don't always listen to novels.

634
00:24:50,980 --> 00:24:52,020
Is it that funny?

635
00:24:53,070 --> 00:24:54,030
Wait, where's the truck?

636
00:24:54,030 --> 00:24:55,830
It's turning around over there.

637
00:24:56,310 --> 00:24:58,590
I just saw a really weird girl.

638
00:24:58,830 --> 00:24:59,510
Where's the ledger?

639
00:24:59,510 --> 00:25:00,240
In the truck.

640
00:25:00,590 --> 00:25:01,400
A girl?

641
00:25:02,750 --> 00:25:03,640
She said she was cold.

642
00:25:03,640 --> 00:25:04,440
And she kept smiling.

643
00:25:04,440 --> 00:25:05,270
Right at the bus stop.

644
00:25:05,270 --> 00:25:06,270
Look.

645
00:25:08,440 --> 00:25:09,570
What girl?

646
00:25:09,680 --> 00:25:10,960
Isn't that a guy?

647
00:25:14,640 --> 00:25:17,200
Are you the one Mr. Bao found for us?

648
00:25:17,880 --> 00:25:18,680
Yes, yes, yes.

649
00:25:22,410 --> 00:25:23,640
I am Chen Jiahao.

650
00:25:23,920 --> 00:25:24,830
Hello, Ms. Zhou.

651
00:25:24,830 --> 00:25:26,400
I'm not Ms. Zhou.

652
00:25:26,510 --> 00:25:27,920
That is Mr. Zhou.

653
00:25:29,030 --> 00:25:29,560
Mr. Zhou.

654
00:25:30,000 --> 00:25:30,640
M-Mr. Zhou.

655
00:25:30,640 --> 00:25:31,960
Come here quickly.

656
00:25:32,200 --> 00:25:32,550
Say hello.

657
00:25:32,550 --> 00:25:33,240
Hello, Mr. Zhou.

658
00:25:33,240 --> 00:25:34,440
Hello, I'm Chen Jiahao.

659
00:25:34,440 --> 00:25:35,070
Hello, hello.

660
00:25:35,070 --> 00:25:36,530
What were you looking for?

661
00:25:37,720 --> 00:25:39,580
Is our village usually this dark?

662
00:25:40,070 --> 00:25:42,000
No. T-This light is always broken.

663
00:25:42,030 --> 00:25:43,440
It's okay. I have a flashlight here.

664
00:25:43,440 --> 00:25:44,310
-I have...
-Oh my god.

665
00:25:44,310 --> 00:25:44,720
I'll find it for you.

666
00:25:44,720 --> 00:25:45,880
No need.

667
00:25:47,200 --> 00:25:48,680
Then... who is this?

668
00:25:49,110 --> 00:25:50,480
I'm Mr. Zhou's agent.

669
00:25:50,480 --> 00:25:51,480
My surname is Lin.

670
00:25:52,310 --> 00:25:53,250
An agent?

671
00:25:54,310 --> 00:25:55,310
So professional.

672
00:25:55,920 --> 00:25:56,380
Well...

673
00:25:56,590 --> 00:25:58,200
You two must be tired from the journey.

674
00:25:58,200 --> 00:26:00,000
Our humble village
is honored by your presence.

675
00:26:00,000 --> 00:26:00,750
Please come in.

676
00:26:00,750 --> 00:26:01,350
Okay.

677
00:26:01,880 --> 00:26:02,350
After you.

678
00:26:02,350 --> 00:26:04,480
Welcome, Mr. Zhou!

679
00:26:06,870 --> 00:26:08,190
And his agent!

680
00:26:08,210 --> 00:26:08,760
Okay.

681
00:26:11,380 --> 00:26:14,680
Welcome, Mr. Zhou and his agent!

682
00:26:17,000 --> 00:26:18,660
This village is really weird.

683
00:26:18,800 --> 00:26:20,320
Why is he so happy?

684
00:26:20,400 --> 00:26:22,030
I told you not to take this job.

685
00:26:22,030 --> 00:26:23,160
Let's go. It's fine.

686
00:26:23,180 --> 00:26:24,000
The place is not big,

687
00:26:24,000 --> 00:26:26,150
but the villagers are very kind.

688
00:26:28,160 --> 00:26:28,880
You two,

689
00:26:29,690 --> 00:26:31,420
does this place look familiar?

690
00:26:32,150 --> 00:26:32,950
It's my house.

691
00:26:33,400 --> 00:26:34,480
-Familiar.
-Familiar.

692
00:26:34,480 --> 00:26:36,110
Stephen Chow's movie,

693
00:26:36,160 --> 00:26:37,290
"King of Comedy"...

694
00:26:37,790 --> 00:26:39,500
This is the filming location.

695
00:26:39,930 --> 00:26:41,540
I recognized it right away.

696
00:26:41,640 --> 00:26:42,830
It was filmed here.

697
00:26:42,830 --> 00:26:43,240
No.

698
00:26:44,640 --> 00:26:46,140
When they were about to film,

699
00:26:46,140 --> 00:26:47,510
a typhoon came here,

700
00:26:47,680 --> 00:26:49,680
so they had to go to Hong Kong to film.

701
00:26:49,720 --> 00:26:50,590
But this set

702
00:26:50,590 --> 00:26:51,580
was left to us.

703
00:26:52,240 --> 00:26:54,100
We invited you two here this time,

704
00:26:54,110 --> 00:26:56,350
hoping we can use this place

705
00:26:56,830 --> 00:26:57,890
to do our business.

706
00:27:00,160 --> 00:27:01,590
"King of Comedy"?

707
00:27:02,030 --> 00:27:04,880
It's not appropriate
to do our business here, right?

708
00:27:04,880 --> 00:27:05,940
It's appropriate.

709
00:27:06,240 --> 00:27:07,510
Don't worry. It's very big inside.

710
00:27:07,510 --> 00:27:09,030
You can decorate it
however you want.

711
00:27:09,030 --> 00:27:10,720
The villagers' affairs
are all handled here.

712
00:27:10,720 --> 00:27:11,750
All handled here?

713
00:27:12,640 --> 00:27:13,790
Then...

714
00:27:14,480 --> 00:27:15,000
Okay.

715
00:27:16,030 --> 00:27:16,830
Okay then.

716
00:27:17,110 --> 00:27:19,170
We'll just follow the local customs.

717
00:27:20,110 --> 00:27:20,960
My house is up there.

718
00:27:20,960 --> 00:27:21,880
Let's go home first.

719
00:27:21,880 --> 00:27:22,270
Okay.

720
00:27:23,160 --> 00:27:23,690
Let's go.

721
00:27:25,310 --> 00:27:26,040
Sure enough,

722
00:27:26,310 --> 00:27:27,550
the core of comedy

723
00:27:28,000 --> 00:27:29,460
-is tragedy.
-Is tragedy.

724
00:27:30,070 --> 00:27:31,530
This place is really nice.

725
00:27:31,590 --> 00:27:33,160
Look, it's facing the sea.

726
00:27:33,920 --> 00:27:35,450
This was left by my parents.

727
00:27:35,920 --> 00:27:37,310
Are your parents at home too?

728
00:27:37,310 --> 00:27:38,640
My parents are gone.

729
00:27:39,400 --> 00:27:40,600
When I was young, they

730
00:27:40,740 --> 00:27:43,070
went out to sea to fish
and never came back.

731
00:27:45,830 --> 00:27:46,690
Please come in.

732
00:27:49,310 --> 00:27:51,640
So he's the only one left
in the family now.

733
00:27:52,030 --> 00:27:53,090
That's so pitiful.

734
00:27:53,510 --> 00:27:55,170
Isn't his family line broken?

735
00:27:56,400 --> 00:27:57,730
He's quite optimistic.

736
00:27:57,830 --> 00:27:58,830
Mr. Zhou, Ms. Lin!

737
00:27:59,200 --> 00:28:00,060
Please come in.

738
00:28:02,400 --> 00:28:03,060
Have a seat.

739
00:28:03,400 --> 00:28:04,060
Have a seat.

740
00:28:10,000 --> 00:28:12,000
I'll get you something to eat first.

741
00:28:12,720 --> 00:28:13,240
Thank you.

742
00:28:13,240 --> 00:28:14,170
You're too kind.

743
00:28:27,550 --> 00:28:28,810
He didn't hang enough.

744
00:28:29,400 --> 00:28:30,470
You're so cutting.

745
00:28:32,960 --> 00:28:34,000
Mr. Zhou, Ms. Lin.

746
00:28:34,550 --> 00:28:35,400
Let's eat first.

747
00:28:35,400 --> 00:28:35,730
Okay.

748
00:28:40,270 --> 00:28:41,030
Well,

749
00:28:41,920 --> 00:28:43,920
with such a big thing
happening in your family,

750
00:28:43,920 --> 00:28:46,150
you're quite optimistic.

751
00:28:47,790 --> 00:28:49,650
I'm still under a lot of pressure.

752
00:28:50,000 --> 00:28:50,930
But that's life.

753
00:28:51,350 --> 00:28:52,750
You have to face everything.

754
00:28:52,750 --> 00:28:53,200
Yes.

755
00:28:53,790 --> 00:28:55,030
So I invited you two

756
00:28:56,000 --> 00:28:56,720
to help me.

757
00:28:57,920 --> 00:28:58,920
You're so strong.

758
00:29:00,030 --> 00:29:01,160
Now that we're here,

759
00:29:01,480 --> 00:29:04,000
we'll definitely make it a grand event.

760
00:29:08,960 --> 00:29:10,400
You two eat first.

761
00:29:11,270 --> 00:29:11,720
Okay.

762
00:29:12,270 --> 00:29:12,870
Thank you.

763
00:29:15,590 --> 00:29:16,920
This is for sobering up.

764
00:29:17,000 --> 00:29:18,000
How does it taste?

765
00:29:19,350 --> 00:29:20,640
Delicious. It's really good.

766
00:29:20,640 --> 00:29:21,430
It's really delicious.

767
00:29:21,430 --> 00:29:23,290
My sister made it before she went.

768
00:29:28,380 --> 00:29:28,940
It's hot.

769
00:29:29,260 --> 00:29:30,390
Let it cool for a bit.

770
00:29:32,920 --> 00:29:35,200
When did your sister go?

771
00:29:35,830 --> 00:29:36,560
Not long ago.

772
00:29:41,090 --> 00:29:43,770
So where is she now?

773
00:29:45,640 --> 00:29:47,330
[Zhen's Fish Ball]

774
00:29:46,590 --> 00:29:48,120
In the refrigerator truck.

775
00:29:49,610 --> 00:29:51,870
[Died young]

776
00:29:52,960 --> 00:29:53,960
In such a hurry?

777
00:29:54,960 --> 00:29:58,720
Don't they usually keep it
at home for a few days?

778
00:30:04,640 --> 00:30:06,240
It can't be kept for too long.

779
00:30:07,680 --> 00:30:08,940
It gets smelly easily.

780
00:30:13,400 --> 00:30:15,330
It might be because it's damp here.

781
00:30:16,860 --> 00:30:18,770
We'd also like to know

782
00:30:19,920 --> 00:30:21,440
according to local customs

783
00:30:21,440 --> 00:30:23,550
or your personal needs,

784
00:30:24,110 --> 00:30:25,030
how many days

785
00:30:25,510 --> 00:30:26,570
you need us to stay.

786
00:30:28,440 --> 00:30:29,790
Just 7 days.

787
00:30:33,750 --> 00:30:35,810
We have to be here for the first 7 days.

788
00:30:38,790 --> 00:30:39,510
You two,

789
00:30:40,680 --> 00:30:41,940
I also have a question.

790
00:30:44,810 --> 00:30:47,850
Is this going to

791
00:30:49,440 --> 00:30:51,350
burn a lot of money?

792
00:30:53,150 --> 00:30:54,950
Normally, you have to burn some.

793
00:30:55,110 --> 00:30:56,640
I didn't prepare that much.

794
00:30:57,240 --> 00:30:59,110
You burn according to what you have.

795
00:30:59,110 --> 00:31:01,110
It's mainly to show your sincerity.

796
00:31:01,880 --> 00:31:03,610
Don't worry. Since we're here,

797
00:31:04,440 --> 00:31:06,500
we'll definitely get it done for you.

798
00:31:13,240 --> 00:31:14,100
Professional.

799
00:31:14,480 --> 00:31:15,270
Not bad.

800
00:31:16,440 --> 00:31:18,510
You two must be tired after a long day.

801
00:31:18,960 --> 00:31:21,090
I'll take you back to your room to rest.

802
00:31:21,310 --> 00:31:21,750
Okay.

803
00:31:33,310 --> 00:31:34,040
Anyone here?

804
00:31:51,720 --> 00:31:54,880
Why do they have to do
this "King of Comedy" thing here?

805
00:31:55,030 --> 00:31:57,160
Isn't this just reheating leftovers?

806
00:31:58,350 --> 00:31:58,960
Mr. Huang.

807
00:31:59,880 --> 00:32:02,350
Mr. Huang, why did you come
in person so late?

808
00:32:02,900 --> 00:32:04,550
Are you hungry? Have something to eat.

809
00:32:04,550 --> 00:32:05,350
It's expired.

810
00:32:05,960 --> 00:32:07,220
It could kill someone.

811
00:32:07,510 --> 00:32:08,030
No.

812
00:32:08,550 --> 00:32:10,030
How could what I give you be expired?

813
00:32:10,030 --> 00:32:10,400
This is...

814
00:32:10,400 --> 00:32:11,480
I'm not talking about the bread,

815
00:32:11,480 --> 00:32:12,720
but the deadline for the demolition.

816
00:32:12,720 --> 00:32:14,780
The date you promised is almost here.

817
00:32:16,760 --> 00:32:17,720
Brother-in-Law. Brother-in-Law.

818
00:32:17,720 --> 00:32:19,160
I found out this ambient light
can be adjusted.

819
00:32:19,160 --> 00:32:19,880
Just this button. Look.

820
00:32:19,880 --> 00:32:20,550
There are two kinds of red.

821
00:32:20,550 --> 00:32:21,400
You're still playing around.

822
00:32:21,400 --> 00:32:22,480
I told you not to call me Brother-in-Law.

823
00:32:22,480 --> 00:32:23,350
What if Mr. Huang hears it?

824
00:32:23,350 --> 00:32:25,030
Can I still keep my job as a secretary?

825
00:32:25,030 --> 00:32:27,170
What Mr. Huang hates the most
is his subordinates

826
00:32:27,170 --> 00:32:29,630
stuffing their relatives into the company.

827
00:32:29,650 --> 00:32:32,720
From now on, we must pretend
we don't know each other well.

828
00:32:32,720 --> 00:32:33,160
Got it?

829
00:32:33,510 --> 00:32:35,000
Understood, Secretary Gao.

830
00:32:35,000 --> 00:32:36,400
Looking at you makes me angry.

831
00:32:36,400 --> 00:32:37,790
I arranged for your mom
to be Mr. Huang's mom's

832
00:32:37,790 --> 00:32:38,510
cook.

833
00:32:38,510 --> 00:32:40,480
As a result, his mom
got thinner and thinner,

834
00:32:40,480 --> 00:32:41,400
and your mom got fatter and fatter.

835
00:32:41,400 --> 00:32:43,440
Did she only cook what she likes to eat?

836
00:32:43,440 --> 00:32:45,440
My mom was already fat to begin with.

837
00:32:45,510 --> 00:32:46,240
And your dad.

838
00:32:46,400 --> 00:32:47,790
I arranged for him
to be the security captain.

839
00:32:47,790 --> 00:32:48,700
Last month, the company's warehouse

840
00:32:48,700 --> 00:32:49,640
got broken into 3 times.

841
00:32:49,640 --> 00:32:50,770
How did that happen?

842
00:32:50,960 --> 00:32:52,760
You have a lot of family members.

843
00:32:53,030 --> 00:32:53,720
Then my aunt...

844
00:32:53,720 --> 00:32:54,440
Get out of here.

845
00:32:54,440 --> 00:32:55,680
You're still trying to stuff people in?

846
00:32:55,680 --> 00:32:58,080
It's almost becoming our family business.

847
00:33:00,160 --> 00:33:01,000
What's more,

848
00:33:01,640 --> 00:33:03,790
Mr. Huang's current financial situation
is not good.

849
00:33:03,790 --> 00:33:04,680
Ma Group

850
00:33:04,750 --> 00:33:06,480
belongs to his father-in-law.

851
00:33:09,270 --> 00:33:10,270
I was wondering

852
00:33:10,270 --> 00:33:11,480
why Mr. Huang's surname is Huang,

853
00:33:11,480 --> 00:33:13,410
but the company is called Ma Group.

854
00:33:14,000 --> 00:33:15,640
So he moved in with his wife's family.

855
00:33:15,640 --> 00:33:17,350
Then he said he wouldn't let
his subordinates stuff people in.

856
00:33:17,350 --> 00:33:18,960
Didn't he stuff himself in?

857
00:33:19,120 --> 00:33:21,310
His father-in-law
has always looked down on him.

858
00:33:21,310 --> 00:33:23,480
He's relying on this Shapu Village project

859
00:33:23,480 --> 00:33:24,720
to turn things around.

860
00:33:24,720 --> 00:33:26,920
If the demolition of Shapu Village fails,

861
00:33:26,920 --> 00:33:27,830
he's finished.

862
00:33:28,240 --> 00:33:29,240
If he's finished,

863
00:33:29,270 --> 00:33:30,070
I'm finished,

864
00:33:30,640 --> 00:33:31,640
you're finished,

865
00:33:31,880 --> 00:33:32,510
your dad,

866
00:33:32,920 --> 00:33:33,550
your mom,

867
00:33:33,850 --> 00:33:35,370
your aunt, and your uncle—

868
00:33:35,400 --> 00:33:36,720
Wait, he's just doing a demolition,

869
00:33:36,720 --> 00:33:38,880
and it's going to wipe out
my entire family?

870
00:33:38,880 --> 00:33:40,030
Then we have to make sure
the Shapu Village

871
00:33:40,030 --> 00:33:41,350
demolition gets done, right?

872
00:33:41,350 --> 00:33:41,830
Yeah.

873
00:33:41,830 --> 00:33:43,030
You should handle this.

874
00:33:43,030 --> 00:33:44,200
That guy from the convenience store—

875
00:33:44,200 --> 00:33:45,240
can he get it done?

876
00:33:45,480 --> 00:33:46,880
Let me teach you a lesson.

877
00:33:47,550 --> 00:33:49,160
For matters in a village like this,

878
00:33:49,160 --> 00:33:50,510
if you want to solve them quickly,

879
00:33:50,510 --> 00:33:51,920
you find either the clan leader

880
00:33:51,920 --> 00:33:52,980
or the local bully.

881
00:33:53,240 --> 00:33:55,770
Chen Junnan happens
to be both the clan leader

882
00:33:55,880 --> 00:33:56,680
and the bully.

883
00:33:57,160 --> 00:33:57,880
Originally,

884
00:33:57,880 --> 00:33:59,880
70% of the people were going to sign.

885
00:34:00,070 --> 00:34:01,790
Why have they all backed out now?

886
00:34:01,790 --> 00:34:03,400
And they want to build some kind of

887
00:34:03,400 --> 00:34:05,060
hometown of "King of Comedy."

888
00:34:05,200 --> 00:34:06,920
Many villagers have already been incited.

889
00:34:06,920 --> 00:34:08,320
What exactly is going on?

890
00:34:09,710 --> 00:34:10,920
It's just a little girl.

891
00:34:10,920 --> 00:34:12,440
It's fine. I've handled it.

892
00:34:12,440 --> 00:34:13,400
Handled what?

893
00:34:13,440 --> 00:34:14,190
I heard

894
00:34:14,670 --> 00:34:16,280
you gave her 7 days.

895
00:34:16,340 --> 00:34:17,449
Seven days.

896
00:34:17,760 --> 00:34:19,070
That's a week!

897
00:34:23,409 --> 00:34:24,639
Indeed, it is.

898
00:34:27,949 --> 00:34:29,949
Mr. Huang, let me tell you the truth.

899
00:34:30,630 --> 00:34:31,760
The little girl...

900
00:34:32,920 --> 00:34:34,850
she's your future sister-in-law.

901
00:34:35,960 --> 00:34:37,150
There were so many people that day.

902
00:34:37,150 --> 00:34:38,030
If anything had happened to her...

903
00:34:38,030 --> 00:34:40,230
My protective instinct just kicked in.

904
00:34:41,070 --> 00:34:41,840
Don't worry.

905
00:34:42,409 --> 00:34:44,070
Even with time, they won't succeed.

906
00:34:44,070 --> 00:34:45,130
When the time is up,

907
00:34:45,320 --> 00:34:46,320
they'll give up.

908
00:34:47,489 --> 00:34:48,820
So I gave them some time.

909
00:34:49,550 --> 00:34:50,949
You fell in love with her?

910
00:34:52,150 --> 00:34:53,110
Completely.

911
00:34:56,710 --> 00:34:58,110
I wasn't wrong about you.

912
00:34:58,700 --> 00:35:00,070
We are the same kind of people,

913
00:35:00,070 --> 00:35:01,320
reckless for love.

914
00:35:03,880 --> 00:35:05,000
Waiting for your good news,

915
00:35:05,000 --> 00:35:06,650
Deputy General Manager Chen.

916
00:35:06,650 --> 00:35:07,280
Mr. Huang.

917
00:35:07,960 --> 00:35:09,360
What did you just call me?

918
00:35:10,150 --> 00:35:11,280
Take down Shapu,

919
00:35:11,670 --> 00:35:13,960
and you'll be Deputy General Manager Chen.

920
00:35:13,960 --> 00:35:15,160
Thank you, Mr. Huang!

921
00:35:15,840 --> 00:35:16,750
-Mr. Huang.
-This village...

922
00:35:16,750 --> 00:35:18,440
What you said about love...

923
00:35:18,840 --> 00:35:19,440
Alright.

924
00:35:19,510 --> 00:35:20,030
Okay.

925
00:35:20,630 --> 00:35:22,360
Gao Jiaoliu who contacted you before—

926
00:35:22,360 --> 00:35:23,020
I fired him.

927
00:35:23,630 --> 00:35:24,880
His name is Gao Jiaoqi.

928
00:35:24,880 --> 00:35:26,480
You two stay in close contact.

929
00:35:26,480 --> 00:35:27,320
Okay.

930
00:35:27,320 --> 00:35:28,120
Number Seven.

931
00:35:29,230 --> 00:35:30,150
Should I call you Mr. Seven,

932
00:35:30,150 --> 00:35:31,110
or Mr. Number?

933
00:35:31,710 --> 00:35:32,770
Whatever you like.

934
00:35:32,880 --> 00:35:34,080
Alright, Mr. Jiaoqi.

935
00:35:34,190 --> 00:35:35,450
Please take care of me.

936
00:35:37,510 --> 00:35:38,590
Careful, Mr. Huang!

937
00:35:38,590 --> 00:35:39,190
Thank you.

938
00:35:40,930 --> 00:35:41,970
Have a safe trip!

939
00:35:44,320 --> 00:35:45,440
Have a safe trip!

940
00:36:08,030 --> 00:36:08,880
What a pity.

941
00:36:33,230 --> 00:36:38,710
[I heard you're going
to hold a funeral for me.]

942
00:36:50,400 --> 00:36:52,710
Mr. Zhou, why do you want
to change places while sleeping?

943
00:36:52,710 --> 00:36:53,920
Is my house uncomfortable?

944
00:36:53,920 --> 00:36:54,800
No.

945
00:36:54,800 --> 00:36:56,190
Then there's no need to wake Ms. Lin up?

946
00:36:56,190 --> 00:36:58,320
If she won't wake up, just leave her be.

947
00:36:58,590 --> 00:36:59,480
Right here.

948
00:37:00,020 --> 00:37:00,680
Right here.

949
00:37:06,080 --> 00:37:06,890
Mr. Zhou.

950
00:37:08,010 --> 00:37:09,820
You can make do here for tonight.

951
00:37:09,920 --> 00:37:11,380
I can only sleep here, right?

952
00:37:11,380 --> 00:37:12,260
It's too late.

953
00:37:12,290 --> 00:37:13,830
I'll find you another place tomorrow.

954
00:37:13,830 --> 00:37:15,430
Yes. As long as it's not home.

955
00:37:16,320 --> 00:37:16,720
Right.

956
00:37:17,280 --> 00:37:18,760
If this switch trips by itself,

957
00:37:18,760 --> 00:37:20,030
just push it back up.

958
00:37:20,030 --> 00:37:20,590
Okay.

959
00:37:23,630 --> 00:37:24,690
There's a bed here.

960
00:37:25,960 --> 00:37:26,490
How is it?

961
00:37:26,670 --> 00:37:29,000
Isn't this just like the one in the movie?

962
00:37:29,280 --> 00:37:31,400
Yes. I feel much safer here.

963
00:37:32,230 --> 00:37:32,920
Jiahao.

964
00:37:33,840 --> 00:37:34,360
Well,

965
00:37:35,230 --> 00:37:36,960
could you stay here with me

966
00:37:36,980 --> 00:37:37,780
for the night?

967
00:37:38,800 --> 00:37:40,030
There's only one bed.

968
00:37:40,190 --> 00:37:43,000
It wouldn't be good for us
to sleep on top of each other.

969
00:37:43,000 --> 00:37:43,730
That's true.

970
00:37:44,360 --> 00:37:46,040
Why didn't you sleep at home?

971
00:37:46,550 --> 00:37:48,010
Because of your sister...

972
00:37:50,360 --> 00:37:51,480
Given your sister's matter,

973
00:37:51,480 --> 00:37:54,140
I want to get familiar
with the venue in advance.

974
00:37:55,280 --> 00:37:56,020
So professional.

975
00:37:56,020 --> 00:37:57,220
It's what I should do.

976
00:37:57,510 --> 00:37:59,570
I'm going to fall asleep standing up.

977
00:37:59,630 --> 00:38:00,830
I'll head back first.

978
00:38:01,230 --> 00:38:02,230
Sorry about that.

979
00:38:11,600 --> 00:38:12,530
Hallucination.

980
00:38:18,290 --> 00:38:19,730
Zhen, let me walk you out.

981
00:38:20,320 --> 00:38:21,380
No need. Thank you.

982
00:38:22,070 --> 00:38:23,270
-Bye-bye.
-Bye-bye.

983
00:38:24,030 --> 00:38:24,560
Let's go.

984
00:38:35,480 --> 00:38:36,550
What's going on?

985
00:38:36,960 --> 00:38:38,550
Didn't even turn off the lights.

986
00:38:38,550 --> 00:38:40,410
Do you think electricity is free?

987
00:39:05,400 --> 00:39:06,860
This really doesn't work.

988
00:39:11,760 --> 00:39:13,490
Stop messing around. Bless me.

989
00:39:13,800 --> 00:39:14,440
Bless me, bless me.

990
00:39:14,440 --> 00:39:15,710
Brothers, bless me.

991
00:39:16,320 --> 00:39:17,520
Stop messing around.

992
00:39:52,590 --> 00:39:54,550
Why did the switch trip by itself?

993
00:40:01,480 --> 00:40:02,680
Why can't you push it?

994
00:40:05,550 --> 00:40:06,170
Mr. Huang,

995
00:40:07,070 --> 00:40:09,360
can you fill up the tank next time?

996
00:40:12,110 --> 00:40:14,760
Who told you to leave the engine running
while waiting for me?

997
00:40:14,760 --> 00:40:17,030
The company's financial situation
is not good right now.

998
00:40:17,030 --> 00:40:18,630
We need to cut costs
and increase efficiency,

999
00:40:18,630 --> 00:40:19,590
and increase income
and reduce expenditure.

1000
00:40:19,590 --> 00:40:23,000
Then Mr. Huang, why do we have to
choose this village?

1001
00:40:23,000 --> 00:40:24,230
There are so many villages nearby.

1002
00:40:24,230 --> 00:40:24,670
Yeah.

1003
00:40:24,670 --> 00:40:26,400
This village is as poor as a church mouse.

1004
00:40:26,400 --> 00:40:27,800
The roads are all broken.

1005
00:40:28,190 --> 00:40:29,840
Near Shapu Village,

1006
00:40:29,840 --> 00:40:32,040
a large trading port will be built soon.

1007
00:40:32,460 --> 00:40:33,920
If we build a factory here,

1008
00:40:33,940 --> 00:40:35,760
it will be highly profitable
in the future.

1009
00:40:35,760 --> 00:40:36,880
What do you know?

1010
00:40:37,440 --> 00:40:38,840
Hurry up and push the car.

1011
00:40:49,960 --> 00:40:50,760
Miss,

1012
00:40:51,440 --> 00:40:53,630
it's fate that we met.

1013
00:40:54,760 --> 00:40:56,560
I'm just doing things for money.

1014
00:40:56,670 --> 00:40:58,930
Don't come to me if you have any problems.

1015
00:40:59,150 --> 00:41:00,840
I don't know what grievances you have.

1016
00:41:00,840 --> 00:41:01,870
You can come to me in my dreams.

1017
00:41:01,870 --> 00:41:03,390
No, better not.

1018
00:41:03,800 --> 00:41:05,330
I'm just an outsider, okay?

1019
00:41:07,400 --> 00:41:08,360
Let's say goodbye here.

1020
00:41:08,360 --> 00:41:09,630
Don't look for me again.

1021
00:41:09,630 --> 00:41:10,360
I'm leaving.

1022
00:41:28,000 --> 00:41:28,730
I'm so tired.

1023
00:41:32,150 --> 00:41:32,950
What's wrong?

1024
00:41:33,800 --> 00:41:34,280
What's wrong?
